        "item_key": "TS3004c#0",
        "type": "actions",
        "text": "The PM will supply five different front designs in a box."
      },
      {
        "item_key": "TS3004c#1",
        "type": "decisions",
        "text": "The remote case should be hard plastic and transparent to enable backlighting."
      },
      {
        "item_key": "TS3004c#2",
        "type": "problems",
        "text": "The remote will not wake up; the power light doesn't work and it appears it may have been turned off."
      },
      {
        "item_key": "TS3004c#3",
        "type": "decisions",
        "text": "Five interchangeable front panels will be provided in a box and used on the remote."
      },
      {
        "item_key": "TS3004c#4",
        "type": "problems",
        "text": "The cost is unclear; although a figure of twelve and a half euros per remote is mentioned, the total production cost remains undefined."
      },
      {
        "item_key": "TS3004c#5",
        "type": "actions",
        "text": "UI will provide UI's design to the group."
      },
      {
        "item_key": "TS3004c#6",
        "type": "problems",
        "text": "There is lack of information about the cost and viability of speech recognition, and discussions have been inconsistent."
      },
      {
        "item_key": "TS3004c#7",
        "type": "actions",
        "text": "ID will discuss the material options with PM."
      }
